1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,908
This is ACME IoT, a building intelligence platform that
runs on the web,

2
00:00:04,958 --> 00:00:07,512
Android and iOS from a single codebase.

3
00:00:07,562 --> 00:00:10,183
Let's sign in with a demo owner account.

4
00:00:11,007 --> 00:00:16,538
The dashboard shows devices online, open alerts, average
temperature and plug load,

5
00:00:16,588 --> 00:00:19,430
next to a live 3D twin of the busiest room.

6
00:00:20,249 --> 00:00:22,203
Every room has its own 3D view.

7
00:00:22,253 --> 00:00:27,829
You can orbit the scene, overlay a temperature heatmap, or
switch to a flat floor plan.

8
00:00:32,299 --> 00:00:36,399
Spaces are organized by organization, building and room.

9
00:00:37,163 --> 00:00:39,109
The device list supports search,

10
00:00:39,159 --> 00:00:43,101
filters and sorting across thermostats, smart plugs and
sensors.

11
00:00:45,093 --> 00:00:48,171
On a thermostat, we raise the target temperature.

12
00:00:48,221 --> 00:00:51,235
The command travels through the HTTP device API,

13
00:00:51,285 --> 00:00:55,639
and the page compares the desired state with what the
device reports.

14
00:00:56,455 --> 00:01:01,565
New devices are registered by scanning a QR code or typing
the claim code from the label.

15
00:01:06,741 --> 00:01:09,868
Automations are simple condition and action rules,

16
00:01:09,918 --> 00:01:12,917
with a cooldown between runs and a full history.

17
00:01:13,744 --> 00:01:17,856
In the simulation lab, we choose a heatwave and advance
time.

18
00:01:17,906 --> 00:01:23,724
Readings, batteries, connectivity, firmware and
automations all move forward together.

19
00:01:24,474 --> 00:01:29,104
Alerts arrive in real time, and operators can acknowledge
or resolve them.

20
00:01:29,857 --> 00:01:34,947
Firmware rollouts track progress, and roll back
automatically when verification fails.

21
00:01:35,699 --> 00:01:40,859
Integrations forward alerts to tools like Slack, and the
team page manages roles.

22
00:01:41,611 --> 00:01:44,793
On a phone, navigation moves to bottom tabs.

23
00:01:44,843 --> 00:01:49,861
Here, a viewer account gets read-only access, with
controls disabled.

24
00:01:50,617 --> 00:01:51,380
ACME IoT.

25
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:56,347
Every building, every room, every device, in one place.

